Description: Generate valid API documentation without build directory paths
 Doxygen interprets @example as a file command; use example paragraphs for
 inline fenced samples. Exclude Debian staging and CMake build output from
 the recursive source scan. Label the main page explicitly so Debian 13
 Doxygen emits working relative search links instead of source file paths.
Author: Qore Technologies, s.r.o.
Forwarded: no
Last-Update: 2026-10-02

--- a/doxygen
+++ b/doxygen
